  "description_short": "Township café in Kwanonqaba serving honest comfort food and community vibes.",
  "description_long": "Tucked away in Kwanonqaba township, CBS Cafe is where locals gather for generous portions and genuine hospitality. The menu covers café classics and satisfying plates that draw a steady crowd of regulars who appreciate the relaxed atmosphere and fair prices.\n\nThe café's strength lies in its no-fuss approach to good food and its role as a neighbourhood meeting spot. Whether you're after a hearty breakfast, a quick lunch, or just a decent cup of coffee, CBS delivers without pretension. It's a taste of authentic Mossel Bay life, away from the tourist trail, where the welcome is warm and the food hits the spot.",
